{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/990717-aspiration-unite-the-created","id":990717,"title":"Aspiration: unite the Created","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-20T18:00:31-07:00","id":990717,"title":"Aspiration: unite the Created","content":"I'm wondering, what would be a good approach/path for a Promethean whose goal is to find some way to bring the scattered Created together into more of a community? <br /> <br /> There was a thread about Azoth 10 Prometheans, and I think this would be a very good goal for a very venerable and powerful Promethean, someone who's up to spend years traveling the world and building connections. It could also be a good concept for a midlevel or higher level campaign- the Throng sets out to work on this goal together. Have their attempts start to attract attention, and see how they deal with it: twisted alchemists or hunters who want them to gather all the Created together so they can wipe them out/harvest them and so on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T07:29:08-07:00","id":990947,"title":"","content":"Well the first thing is.... holy crap that's a bad idea. Not what you wrote, but for the poor Promethean trying to do this.<br /> <br /> It'd be Firestorm City if they all met. Heck even just two or three throngs meeting would mean firestorms everywhere.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, if they just want to find a way to connect them &quot;internet-style&quot;, that's basically what the Azothic Memory is. I guess a Promethean could try and create an Alembic/Athanor/whatever which would allow long distance communication. Or they could just use the internet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T11:05:32-07:00","id":991039,"title":"","content":"What Magnum said. The 1e story settings for (post-Katrina) New Orleans and Boston touched a bit on building a more connected Prommie community, though, so while it might be a really bad idea, that doesn't mean it can't be an interesting Aspiration..!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;ba